### =====================================================================
### Cloud WMS 接口演示（VS Code / Codespaces 的 REST Client 插件）
### 1. 先在终端启动：mvn spring-boot:run -Dspring-boot.run.profiles=dev
### 2. 从上到下逐个点击每段上方的 “Send Request”
###    后面的请求会自动引用前面返回的订单 ID、SKU ID、包裹 ID
### =====================================================================

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@tenant = 1
@operator = pack-01

### 查看库存（dev 测试数据：仓库 1 = LAX1）
GET {{base}}/inventory?warehouseId=1
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

### 1. 新建出库单（标准出库单 API，任何订单来源都转换成这个格式）
# @name create
POST {{base}}/outbound-orders
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "customerId": 1,
  "source": "SHOPIFY",
  "externalOrderNo": "DEMO-{{$timestamp}}",
  "shipTo": {
    "name": "Sam Ortiz",
    "address1": "1 Market St",
    "city": "San Francisco",
    "state": "CA",
    "zip": "94105",
    "country": "US",
    "residential": true
  },
  "lines": [ { "skuCode": "ACME-HEADLAMP", "qty": 2 } ]
}

### 2. 分配库存
POST {{base}}/outbound-orders/{{create.response.body.id}}/allocate
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

### 3. 拣货确认
POST {{base}}/outbound-orders/{{create.response.body.id}}/pick
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

### 4. 打包称重
POST {{base}}/outbound-orders/{{create.response.body.id}}/pack
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "packages": [
    {
      "boxType": "BOX-S",
      "weightLb": 1.2,
      "items": [ { "skuId": {{create.response.body.$.lines[0].skuId}}, "qty": 2 } ]
    }
  ]
}

### 5. 比价：查看 UPS / FedEx / USPS 全部报价与最优服务（模拟价格）
POST {{base}}/outbound-orders/{{create.response.body.id}}/rates
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

### 6. 按最优服务打单发货（扣库存、记计费事件）
POST {{base}}/outbound-orders/{{create.response.body.id}}/ship
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}
X-Operator: {{operator}}

### 7. 查看订单：状态 SHIPPED、包裹追踪号、运费
# @name order
GET {{base}}/outbound-orders/{{create.response.body.id}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

### 8. 取回 ZPL 面单（可直接发送到 Zebra 热敏打印机）
GET {{base}}/packages/{{order.response.body.$.packages[0].id}}/label
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

### 9. 库存对账（应返回空数组 []）
GET {{base}}/inventory/reconcile
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 其他场景
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 同一外部单号重复推送：返回 200 与原订单（duplicate = true），不会重复建单
POST {{base}}/outbound-orders
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "warehouseId": 1, "customerId": 1, "source": "API", "externalOrderNo": "DUP-TEST-1",
  "shipTo": { "name": "A", "address1": "1 Main St", "city": "Austin", "state": "TX", "zip": "78701", "country": "US", "residential": true },
  "lines": [ { "skuCode": "ACME-BOTTLE-32", "qty": 1 } ]
}

### 库存不足：拣货位只有 6 把椅子，订购 30 把 → 409，订单保持 NEW
# @name short
POST {{base}}/outbound-orders
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "warehouseId": 1, "customerId": 1, "source": "API", "externalOrderNo": "SHORT-{{$timestamp}}",
  "shipTo": { "name": "B", "address1": "500 Main St", "city": "Boulder", "state": "CO", "zip": "80302", "country": "US", "residential": false },
  "lines": [ { "skuCode": "ACME-CHAIR", "qty": 30 } ]
}

###
POST {{base}}/outbound-orders/{{short.response.body.id}}/allocate
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}
